<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Louis II de La Trémoille</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1460">1460</a>–<a href="/years/1525">1525</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Louis II de La Trémoille was a French commander who served Charles VIII, Louis XII and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/francis-i">Francis I</a>. In 1488 he defeated the Breton army at Saint-Aubin-du-Cormier, and he later fought in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-wars">Italian Wars</a> at Fornovo, Agnadello and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-marignano">Marignano</a>. He was killed at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-pavia">Battle of Pavia</a> in 1525.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/louis-ii-de-la-tremoille.jpg" alt="Louis II de La Trémoille" width="320" height="468" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: anonymous / Unidentified painter · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LouisIIdeLaTremoille.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Francis II’s army, reinforced by English, German and Castilian troops, was crushed by <b>Louis de La Trémoille</b> at the Battle of Saint-Aubin-du-Cormier on 28 July 1488.</blockquote><a href="/empire/duchy-of-brittany">Duchy of Brittany · Military</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Bommiers, in what is now <a href="/countries/france">France</a>. Died in Pavia, in what is now <a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=46.8,1.99&amp;year=1502" aria-label="Bommiers on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4597 520 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Louis II de La Trémoille"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5047 790h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5047 790h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=46.8,1.99&amp;year=1502">What was here in 1502? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
